  ("How much does a multi zone mini split cost in Ontario?", "Multi-zone ductless systems in Ontario start at $5,500 installed with EHI, and the final price depends on the outdoor unit size, the number and style of heads and how far the line sets run. We quote a guaranteed final price after a room-by-room design visit, before any work begins."),
